# The home grid on the Pi 4B's portrait 5" DSI (108x65 mm: 7.4 px/mm against the Pi 3A+'s 8.57 in zone_home), the
# writing zone's band hidden (report 042): three columns on both panels. Golden at 480x800.
title zone home pi4b
sizes 480x800
profile pda
env APPLAUNCH_PANEL_MM 108x65
apps Settings Store CLI SSH Calculator "Mesh Hop=ip_panel_100.png" "RSS Reader=store_100.png" "Net Toolbox=ssh_100.png" "Serial Console=cli_100.png"
clock 20:30
wifi 70
bt on
home
expect_zone hidden
shot zone_home_pi4b
